fixture wall_coyote
doc BUILD.md s5 Wall "Wall-jump"; s5 Jump "Coyote time 6 f"; docs/adr/0010 wall coyote time: a jump within 6 frames of pushing away from a cling is still a wall-jump
room test/shaft
spawn 760 300
frames 40
input
  0..9 R
  # Push away from the cling, and press jump 3 frames later, already more than 3 u from the wall.
  10..12 L
  13..20 L jump
  21..39 L
end
expect
  at 9 state=wall
  at 10 state=air
  at 13 event.wall_jump=1 event.air_jump=0
end
